{"pin":"BH01503","subcodes":[{"code":"BH01503","anchor":"","first_line":"Praise be unto Him Who hath manifested, brought forth, sent down and made evident His Revelation, His sovereignty, His signs and His path [3.5s]... ...Peace and blessings be upon the day-spring of His names, the dawning-place of His attributes, the well-spring of His knowledge, the source of His cause, and the manifestation of His laws and commandments… Praised be Thou, O God, my God! These are the days whereon Thou hast enjoined Thy chosen ones, Thy loved ones and Thy servants to observe the Fast","first_line_orig":"الحمد لله الذی اظهر و ابرز و انزل و اوضح ظهوره و سلطانه و آیاته و صراطه و  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"570","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15700.200","source":"BLIB_Or15700","locator":"200"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15711.067","source":"BLIB_Or15711","locator":"067"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMUH#02x","source":"MMUH","locator":"02x","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/mukhtarat-minan-nususul-bahaiyya-fi-bayani-maqam-i-muhammad-rasulullah.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"OOL.B090.13x","source":"OOL","locator":"B090.13x","url":"https://oceanoflights.org/bahaullah-st-090-13-ar"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BPRY.286x","source":"BPRY","locator":"286x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/354381432"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_IOPF#3.05x","source":"BRL_IOPF","locator":"3.05x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/005616020"},{"kind":"translation","code":"KSHK#20x","source":"KSHK","locator":"20x","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211026145946/http://www.kashkul.org/2010/12/19/peace-be-upon-muhammad/"}]},{"code":"BH01503ENJ","anchor":"enj","translations":[{"language":"uk","lang_name":"Ukrainian"},{"language":"no","lang_name":"Norwegian"},{"language":"th","lang_name":"Thai"},{"language":"ja","lang_name":"Japanese"},{"language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"language":"sne","lang_name":"Bau Bidayuh"},{"language":"ta","